.TH EMERALD.MASK 5 "2026-09-07" "emerald" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
emerald.mask \- ports excluded from system upgrades
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I @SYSCONFDIR@/emerald.mask
contains package or port names that \fBemerald sysup\fR must not upgrade. Each entry is a single name on its own line.
.SH FORMAT
.EX
# one port per line
linux-firmware
some-port
.EE
.PP
Blank lines and lines beginning with \fB#\fR are ignored. Names are matched as package names; an installed version may be shown by \fBemerald mask list\fR.
.SH MANAGEMENT
Use \fBemerald mask list\fR, \fBemerald mask add PORT...\fR, and \fBemerald mask remove PORT...\fR. Changes require root privileges.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR emerald (1)
